            "review_title": "Review at Pho Bien Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Fouregas\nUnited States5104 contributions\n0\nSeafood pretty good\nMar 2018 • Friends\nThis restaurant appears to cater to many tour groups and we are one of them.\n\nStill the quality of seafood was quite good. We had grilled tiger shrimps, calamari, meats, veggies and center of table was the fish soup with veggies that you ladle soup onto your bowl of bun (cooked white rice noodles) and it's delicious.\nRead more\nWritten March 13, 2018",
